Tool `search_existing_docs` (owner `agent`): via `notion`; needs `notion_account`; adds `existing_docs_checked`.
Tool `write_process_document` (owner `agent`): via `reply`; requires `process_information_gathered`; adds `sop_delivered`.
Tool `publish_sop_to_wiki` (owner `agent`): via `notion`; needs `notion_account`; requires `sop_delivered`; adds `sop_published`.
Initially true: `user_conversation_available`.
